American Academy of Orthopaedic Surgeons. Management of Rotator Cuff Injuries: Evidence-Based Clinical Practice Guideline. Adopted 18 August 2025. English.

[Authorized source](https://www.aaos.org/quality/quality-programs/rotator-cuff/).

The official page links the full guideline, review report, and related material. [Full manuscript](https://www.aaos.org/globalassets/quality-and-practice-resources/rotator-cuff/rotator-cuff-2025/rotator-cuff-cpg.pdf). Read methods, populations, recommendation strength, evidence, and limitations as well as summaries. This concerns adult cuff injuries; it is not a pediatric guideline or a general rule for every painful shoulder.

**Access and reuse:** Freely readable on the author, publisher, or institution website. Copyright remains with the stated rights holder; no local copy or permission to adapt is supplied.

